      <ul>
      <li>
      <strong>system-node-critical</strong> - This priority class has a value of 2000001000 and is used for all pods that should never be evicted from a node. Examples of pods that have this priority class are <code>ovnkube-node</code>, and so forth. A number of critical components include the <code>system-node-critical</code> priority class by default, for example:
