      <li>
      Create a YAML file similar to the following:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nmetadata:\n  name: nginx\n  labels:\n    env: test\nspec:\n  securityContext:\n    runAsNonRoot: true\n    seccompProfile:\n      type: RuntimeDefault\n  containers:\n  - name: nginx\n    image: nginx\n    imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent\n    securityContext:\n      allowPrivilegeEscalation: false\n      capabilities:\n        drop: [ALL]\n  priorityClassName: high-priority"} lang="yaml" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.priorityClassName</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the priority class to use with this pod.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
      Create the pod:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc create -f <file-name>.yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>You can add the priority name directly to the pod configuration or to a pod template.</p>
      </li>
      </ol>
      </li>
      </ol>
